(function(){
  "use strict";
  window.CAST_VOICE_LIBRARY={"version":2,"cdnBase":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/voicelines/images/","aliases":{"Junko Enoshima (Disguise)":"Junko Enoshima","Mukuro Ikusaba":"Junko Enoshima"},"profiles":{"Makoto Naegi":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Makoto_Naegi","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01107","path":"f/f6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01107.ogg","text":"Before we go any farther, I guess I should introduce myself. My name's Makoto Naegi."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01195","path":"3/35/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01195.ogg","text":"My name's Makoto Naegi."}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00002","path":"8/8b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00002.ogg","text":"With the way things have been damaged, I think we can definitely assume there was a struggle."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00004","path":"6/66/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00004.ogg","text":"No. I do think it was a knife- but not just any knife. I'm almost positive it was a kitchen knife."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00006","path":"a/a1/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00006.ogg","text":"Hold on a second! I'm-!"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00039","path":"b/b3/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00039.ogg","text":"Wh-What the hell is that supposed to mean!? Why would she lie about something like that!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00097","path":"7/7a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00097.ogg","text":"Difficult, absolutely. Impossible? I don't think so. Because the killer is..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00021","path":"e/e1/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00021.ogg","text":"That's right! There wasn't a single hair on the floor!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00056","path":"9/97/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00056.ogg","text":"Actually, no. I don't think the fight started with the sword."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00098","path":"0/0c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00098.ogg","text":"Because the killer is the Ultimate Baseball Star. Isn't that right, Leon!?"}]},"2":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00148","path":"f/ff/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00148.ogg","text":"I... might know one reason he could be involved..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00149","path":"d/d5/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00149.ogg","text":"I found this file while I was looking around the archive in the library..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00154","path":"4/4e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00154.ogg","text":"I think I read that somewhere in the file, too..."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00244","path":"9/96/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00244.ogg","text":"She never said anything about the jacket's color!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00195","path":"0/0f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00195.ogg","text":"Um, sorry but could we hold on for just a second?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00262","path":"0/01/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00262.ogg","text":"...Mondo! Your handbook got broken in the sauna, didn't it?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00272","path":"3/33/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00272.ogg","text":"After all, Monokuma said himself that Leon's handbook never should've broken."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00274","path":"a/ab/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00274.ogg","text":"I'm happy to admit I made a mistake. But..."}]},"3":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00321","path":"b/bf/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00321.ogg","text":"Are we sure Hiro really made those blueprints?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00322","path":"8/8d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00322.ogg","text":"Well, take a look at this."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00323","path":"2/20/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00323.ogg","text":"It's the note that Hiro wrote, asking everyone to meet up after Alter Ego disappeared."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00540","path":"c/c1/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00540.ogg","text":"...Celeste! Sorry, you lose."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00485","path":"3/35/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00485.ogg","text":"And that's Celeste! She never actually told us what her real name is!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00493","path":"4/4a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00493.ogg","text":"Can you please just tell us what really happened?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00376","path":"e/e7/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00376.ogg","text":"See? Look - It broke with the hands pointing just past 6:00!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00430","path":"c/ce/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00430.ogg","text":"But there's more! Look where the note says to meet!"}]},"4":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00544","path":"3/30/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00544.ogg","text":"Hiro, when we were talking before, you dropped a small piece of paper, remember?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00545","path":"0/04/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00545.ogg","text":"It was white with red polka dots."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00546","path":"1/1d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00546.ogg","text":"In that case, Hiro, where did you get that piece of candy?"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00665","path":"1/19/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00665.ogg","text":"I can't believe it either. Or rather, I don't want to believe it."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00623","path":"6/65/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00623.ogg","text":"Hina, please! I'd like to know too!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00556","path":"f/f3/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00556.ogg","text":"Tell us the truth, Hiro. When did you see the message?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00632","path":"7/7b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00632.ogg","text":"No, that can't be it! Remember what Hina just said?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00616","path":"d/d5/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00616.ogg","text":"Did you really... kill Sakura? And if you did-!"}]},"5":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00729","path":"e/e0/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00729.ogg","text":"I'm talking about her gloves. They'll give us some insight to the mystery, I'm sure of it!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00731","path":"7/77/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00731.ogg","text":"Whoever it was, they were wearing fake nails, remember?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00732","path":"7/7d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00732.ogg","text":"I imagine trying to wear gloves over nails like that, would've been a pretty big pain."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00838","path":"7/7d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00838.ogg","text":"W-wait a second! You've got it all wrong!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00756","path":"a/a5/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00756.ogg","text":"Sorry Toko, but you're wrong."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00795","path":"4/41/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00795.ogg","text":"In other words, the victim never wore that bloodstained coat until after they were dead!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00804","path":"0/0c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00804.ogg","text":"The explosion severely damaged the body, making it impossible to know what really killed her!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00735","path":"1/1f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00735.ogg","text":"Then that's that! The dead body doesn't belong to Kyoko!"}]},"6":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00860","path":"5/54/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00860.ogg","text":"It's not just you three, I have evidence too!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00861","path":"3/3a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00861.ogg","text":"The evidence you're all referring to is this group photo, right?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00862","path":"1/17/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00862.ogg","text":"Hiro, you have a picture too, right? Let's see it."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01096","path":"6/63/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01096.ogg","text":"As long as there's hope, we'll never give up!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01062","path":"5/5a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01062.ogg","text":"It could only have been...the headmaster of Hope's Peak Academy!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01065","path":"f/f6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01065.ogg","text":"That's why he asked us to make that promise!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01079","path":"9/9d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01079.ogg","text":"I refuse to give in! I refuse to lose to you!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00993","path":"8/86/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.00993.ogg","text":"She's the true mastermind, and the Ultimate Despair!"}]}}},"Monokuma":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Monokuma","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05510","path":"b/bc/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05510.ogg","text":"Now then."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05512","path":"b/bb/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05512.ogg","text":"Hey, umm..."}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05269","path":"3/32/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05269.ogg","text":"Let's begin with a basic explanation of the class trial. So, your votes will determine the results."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05270","path":"b/b9/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05270.ogg","text":"If you can figure out 'whodunnit', then only they will receive punishment. But if you pick the wrong one..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05271","path":"a/aa/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05271.ogg","text":"...then I'll punish everyone besides the blackened, and the one that deceived everyone else will graduate!"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05280","path":"c/ca/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05280.ogg","text":"Oops! Did I say that out loud?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05284","path":"2/21/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05284.ogg","text":"Hey, HEY! You guys have totally derailed the argument!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05276","path":"1/10/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05276.ogg","text":"First up is the case summary. Now, let the class trial... begin!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05277","path":"7/77/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05277.ogg","text":"So you ask, and so I shall answer!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05279","path":"5/56/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05279.ogg","text":"Ugh, good grief! Enough already! No, okay? There are no accomplices in this case!"}]},"2":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05295","path":"a/ae/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05295.ogg","text":"If you can figure out 'whodunnit' then only they will receive punishment! But if you pick the wrong one..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05296","path":"d/df/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05296.ogg","text":"...then I'll punish everyone besides the blackened, and the one that deceived everyone else will graduate."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05297","path":"4/46/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05297.ogg","text":"Okay then! So, first off..."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05341","path":"1/1a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05341.ogg","text":"Will you make the right choice? Or the dreadfully wrong one?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05302","path":"8/8e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05302.ogg","text":"Yup yup yup! Hit the nail square on the noggin!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05304","path":"1/10/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05304.ogg","text":"Wait wait wait wait wait! Just what do you think you're doing?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05306","path":"7/77/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05306.ogg","text":"Well alright then! I declare an official class trial recess!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05311","path":"7/76/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05311.ogg","text":"Puhuhuhu! Yes, that certainly does make things much more exciting!"}]},"3":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05344","path":"5/57/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05344.ogg","text":"If you can figure out 'whodunnit', then only they will receive punishment! But if you pick the wrong one..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05345","path":"9/98/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05345.ogg","text":"...then I'll punish everyone besides the blackened, and the one that deceived everyone else will graduate."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05346","path":"3/37/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05346.ogg","text":"Now then, to begin with..."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05353","path":"9/9f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05353.ogg","text":"If you would, please locate your lever and cast your vote."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05344","path":"5/57/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05344.ogg","text":"If you can figure out 'whodunnit', then only they will receive punishment! But if you pick the wrong one..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05352","path":"8/8b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05352.ogg","text":"It is indeed the moment we've all been voting for. Time to vote, okay? Okay!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05354","path":"7/77/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05354.ogg","text":"And when the votes are tallied, who will become the blackened?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05355","path":"2/2b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05355.ogg","text":"Will you make the right choice, or the dreadfully wrong one? What's it gonna be? What's it gonna be-ee-EE?"}]},"4":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05357","path":"5/51/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05357.ogg","text":"If you can figure out 'whodunnit', then only they will receive punishment. But if you pick the wrong one..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05358","path":"c/c6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05358.ogg","text":"...then I'll punish everyone besides the blackened, and the one that deceived everyone else will get to graduate."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05359","path":"2/23/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05359.ogg","text":"Now then, where to begin?"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05362","path":"d/d6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05362.ogg","text":"Did you guys forget already? You still haven't voted yet!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05366","path":"6/6b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05366.ogg","text":"Maybe you don't want to, but please grab your lever and cast your vote!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05368","path":"4/4f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05368.ogg","text":"Will you make the right choice, or the dreadfully wrong one?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05365","path":"0/00/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05365.ogg","text":"Well whatever, you don't really have a choice anyway. You just gotta do it!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05364","path":"7/73/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05364.ogg","text":"Ah, I can feel my energy draining out of me."}]},"5":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05371","path":"5/5b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05371.ogg","text":"If you can figure out 'whodunnit', then only they will receive punishment. But if you pick the wrong one..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05372","path":"b/b2/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05372.ogg","text":"...then I'll punish everyone besides the blackened, and the one that deceived everyone else will graduate!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05373","path":"8/87/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05373.ogg","text":"Okay, well, I'll leave the rest up to you!"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05377","path":"4/4e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05377.ogg","text":"Please limit all future prattle, chatter, and chit-chat as much as possible~!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05373","path":"8/87/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05373.ogg","text":"Okay, well, I'll leave the rest up to you!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05381","path":"f/f6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05381.ogg","text":"Hammer that point straight into your big ol' brains!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05387","path":"b/bc/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05387.ogg","text":"Time's up! Class trial's all over! Everyone can stop talking now!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05389","path":"d/db/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05389.ogg","text":"So then, it's time for our voting time, okay? Everyone, please vote using the lever in front of you!"}]},"6":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05399","path":"7/74/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05399.ogg","text":"So listen up!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05401","path":"0/00/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05401.ogg","text":"You guys win!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05402","path":"1/11/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05402.ogg","text":"But if you can't..."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05493","path":"5/52/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05493.ogg","text":"Fear is only possible where hope is possible. I only have despair, so fear is an alien concept to me."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05406","path":"4/45/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05406.ogg","text":"Of course not! Bears never go back on their word!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05492","path":"8/8c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05492.ogg","text":"Afraid? What's that mean, afraid?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05407","path":"2/28/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05407.ogg","text":"Oh, you're taking this serious, huh? Are you feeling okay?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05453","path":"7/75/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05453.ogg","text":"Uh, sorry... Did I say that out loud? I do hope I didn't hurt your feelings."}]}}},"Aoi Asahina":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Aoi_Asahina","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04155","path":"d/db/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04155.ogg","text":"Heya! I'm Aoi Asahina, but my friends just call me Hina. 'Sup?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04159","path":"d/db/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04159.ogg","text":"So, um..."}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03747","path":"a/a4/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03747.ogg","text":"Y-yeah, that's right."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03748","path":"7/77/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03748.ogg","text":"Umm... no, I don't think so..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03749","path":"8/80/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03749.ogg","text":"No, he definitely wasn't there!"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03750","path":"c/cf/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03750.ogg","text":"Idiot swimmer girl!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03768","path":"3/31/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03768.ogg","text":"Then... we just have to figure out what happened during the fight, right?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03751","path":"a/a8/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03751.ogg","text":"Oh, and more importantly, why would I get involved in something like that!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03760","path":"5/54/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03760.ogg","text":"Oh! As a matter of fact, I do have one question!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03764","path":"6/62/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03764.ogg","text":"Oh man! I've totally seen people do that on detective shows!"}]},"2":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03774","path":"6/67/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03774.ogg","text":"You... looked at her head wound?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03775","path":"4/42/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03775.ogg","text":"But... that's impossible!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03776","path":"5/5c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03776.ogg","text":"Well, I mean... Come on!"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03789","path":"e/e8/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03789.ogg","text":"Yeah, I could never believe a word you say, you monster!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03781","path":"a/a6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03781.ogg","text":"Toko has, like, bloodophobia or whatever, remember? What kind of serial killer is afraid of blood!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03809","path":"7/79/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03809.ogg","text":"Then it must hold some clue about the culprit, right!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03810","path":"b/bc/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03810.ogg","text":"Just tell us already! Why would we wanna break our own handbooks!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03775","path":"4/42/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03775.ogg","text":"But... that's impossible!"}]},"3":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03815","path":"2/21/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03815.ogg","text":"Hiro, why? Why did you kill them?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03817","path":"5/55/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03817.ogg","text":"Then who was in that Robo Justice suit!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03818","path":"c/c6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03818.ogg","text":"Is it like Hiro said? Was there really someone running around in a second suit?"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03877","path":"0/0c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03877.ogg","text":"I-I don't believe it! Everything, the whole thing, was one big act!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03874","path":"4/48/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03874.ogg","text":"Th-That's just... awful! How could anyone be so cruel!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03817","path":"5/55/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03817.ogg","text":"Then who was in that Robo Justice suit!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03849","path":"c/cb/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03849.ogg","text":"But I mean... we found his body! He was dead!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03837","path":"4/47/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03837.ogg","text":"We already know what order they were killed in!"}]},"4":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03885","path":"4/4e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03885.ogg","text":"Is one of the people who hated her! Byakuya, Toko, or Hiro! It was one of you!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03886","path":"9/9d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03886.ogg","text":"I don't wanna hear your stupid excuses!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03887","path":"2/29/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03887.ogg","text":"It was one of you..."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03923","path":"b/b1/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03923.ogg","text":"What's wrong? Come on, everyone, we're ready to vote, right? Let's do this!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03911","path":"f/f7/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03911.ogg","text":"What are you talking about? What else could there be!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03955","path":"8/8d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03955.ogg","text":"Y-Yeah! That's just how it was. What can I do?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03905","path":"3/35/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03905.ogg","text":"I don't even know where to begin with that one!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03921","path":"7/73/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03921.ogg","text":"Sakura was just worried about you, and you... you're terrible!"}]},"5":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04001","path":"7/7d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04001.ogg","text":"Her traits?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04004","path":"4/4b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04004.ogg","text":"If anyone doesn't know women, it's you!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04005","path":"4/47/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04005.ogg","text":"There's gotta be some way to figure it out."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04035","path":"6/68/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04035.ogg","text":"No, not that! I just remembered something super serious!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04040","path":"2/2f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04040.ogg","text":"It really is, isn't it? I was afraid of that..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04045","path":"0/0f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04045.ogg","text":"I might be dumb, but even I'm not dumb enough to believe that!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04030","path":"9/97/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04030.ogg","text":"Sorry, I'm having a tough time keeping up. What settles what?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04047","path":"b/b6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04047.ogg","text":"Oh! Then the explosion was 'cause of the Monokuma bomb!"}]},"6":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04065","path":"f/f4/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04065.ogg","text":"You're all out to get me, I'm sure of it!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04066","path":"2/23/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04066.ogg","text":"I have evidence of my own!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04067","path":"1/10/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04067.ogg","text":"W-Well, yeah!"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04135","path":"a/a7/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04135.ogg","text":"I could never lose something like that!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04082","path":"d/df/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04082.ogg","text":"You lie! I never did any kind of interview!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04078","path":"9/9e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04078.ogg","text":"I promise you, I haven't lost my memory!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04084","path":"0/00/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04084.ogg","text":"You expect me to believe all this? That I... I lost my memory somehow!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04122","path":"d/d6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04122.ogg","text":"How could taking away someone's memories... give them hope?"}]}}},"Byakuya Togami":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Byakuya_Togami","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01977","path":"5/52/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01977.ogg","text":"Don't make me repeat myself."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01981","path":"9/95/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01981.ogg","text":"It's all clear now."}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01365","path":"c/cc/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01365.ogg","text":"That much should've been obvious just by looking at the scene. It shouldn't even need explaining."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01366","path":"a/aa/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01366.ogg","text":"You don't think so?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01367","path":"f/ff/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01367.ogg","text":"Speaking of which, I'd like to ask the bear, if there is an accomplice, do they also become blackened?"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01368","path":"7/77/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01368.ogg","text":"Why didn't you say so in the first place?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01382","path":"f/fc/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01382.ogg","text":"So, you have no rebuttal?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01366","path":"a/aa/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01366.ogg","text":"You don't think so?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01378","path":"0/06/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01378.ogg","text":"And if it's true that she had the kitchen knife and attacked without provocation..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01372","path":"3/3d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01372.ogg","text":"That is... a definite possibility."}]},"2":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01384","path":"8/89/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01384.ogg","text":"Although, I believe the criminal behind this heinous act is already quite clear."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01388","path":"5/57/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01388.ogg","text":"Case closed, as far as I'm concerned."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01389","path":"9/9d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01389.ogg","text":"Why? What makes it impossible?"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01462","path":"f/f6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01462.ogg","text":"What's wrong? I asked you if you think that's what happened."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01394","path":"7/70/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01394.ogg","text":"But more important is the other characteristic, and it's something that has never been made public."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01410","path":"b/b3/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01410.ogg","text":"Toko was afraid. Afraid of the murderous fiend inside of her, of killing even more people."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01452","path":"e/ec/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01452.ogg","text":"Interesting. Very interesting indeed. But your reasoning is still too weak."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01456","path":"1/18/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01456.ogg","text":"I've never seen that rope before in my life."}]},"3":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01502","path":"d/dd/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01502.ogg","text":"The suspicious individual hidden within the suit.."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01503","path":"2/2d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01503.ogg","text":"Go ahead Makoto. Tell them who it was."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01504","path":"6/6c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01504.ogg","text":"Then there can be no doubt. Hiro is the prime suspect."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01553","path":"5/5c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01553.ogg","text":"That means Hifumi knew the note was important."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01575","path":"9/91/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01575.ogg","text":"And when we'd all come to see what was wrong, what was it she said?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01519","path":"3/3c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01519.ogg","text":"And from there, the body was moved to the repository, correct?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01557","path":"8/8b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01557.ogg","text":"Is it not possible they used a different weapon?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01605","path":"f/f2/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01605.ogg","text":"How long do you plan to go on pretending?"}]},"4":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01609","path":"9/96/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01609.ogg","text":"And what reason do you have for saying so?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01610","path":"c/cc/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01610.ogg","text":"Is that it? That doesn't make any sense."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01611","path":"a/a5/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01611.ogg","text":"I don't deny that she wanted to meet with us, but..."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01711","path":"b/b7/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01711.ogg","text":"What the hell? What's going on here?!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01713","path":"8/8d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01713.ogg","text":"New evidence? Impossible, there can't be!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01741","path":"4/4e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01741.ogg","text":"Er, sorry. Please, tell us."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01715","path":"7/73/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01715.ogg","text":"Just say it already! What is it you think you've found?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01621","path":"c/c0/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01621.ogg","text":"Stop wasting my time. Just tell us the truth."}]},"5":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01752","path":"a/a6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01752.ogg","text":"There's a limit to how much ridiculousness I can tolerate."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01753","path":"a/a1/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01753.ogg","text":"In that case, I think it would be helpful if someone explained why she actually wears those gloves."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01754","path":"6/6d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01754.ogg","text":"In fact, Monokuma told me. Apparently you have scars on your hands you don't want anyone to see."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01770","path":"5/5f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01770.ogg","text":"But how can we trust that? We already know your information about Mukuro was wrong."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01768","path":"e/e1/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01768.ogg","text":"So you're saying she wasn't an important character?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01813","path":"4/43/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01813.ogg","text":"Well don't just stand there, out with it!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01797","path":"a/a0/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01797.ogg","text":"She thought Mukuro was the Ultimate Despair, in other words the mastermind behind everything."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01828","path":"3/3f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01828.ogg","text":"The victim's fatal injury has yet to be determined, correct?"}]},"6":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01877","path":"b/be/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01877.ogg","text":"Evidence that proves everyone other than me has been working together."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01878","path":"b/b0/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01878.ogg","text":"As long as we're talking about it, I suppose I should show you my photo as well."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01879","path":"6/66/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01879.ogg","text":"It's just like Makoto said. Everyone but me appears in the photo, wearing the same school uniform."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01968","path":"8/88/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01968.ogg","text":"It never even crossed my mind that I might give in to despair."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01958","path":"c/c0/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01958.ogg","text":"What? What the hell are you talking about?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01952","path":"d/d8/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01952.ogg","text":"Just answer the question! What happened out there?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01927","path":"2/2a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01927.ogg","text":"And we never would've known the difference."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01956","path":"e/e6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01956.ogg","text":"Oh come on, now you're just being ridiculous!"}]}}},"Celestia Ludenberg":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Celestia_Ludenberg","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05019","path":"3/32/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05019.ogg","text":"\"Mhmhmm...\" (Sort of like laughing)"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05021","path":"c/cd/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05021.ogg","text":"Are you okay with this?"}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04770","path":"e/e6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04770.ogg","text":"There were only fifteen of us to begin with, so why are there sixteen seats?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04771","path":"5/5a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04771.ogg","text":"She must have been attacked in the main room first, then she ran to the bathroom to try and hide."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04773","path":"3/39/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04773.ogg","text":"Hina seems the obvious candidate. After all, she just said she was in the dining hall..."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04782","path":"7/7a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04782.ogg","text":"But can we be sure anyone even got this note?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04784","path":"d/dc/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04784.ogg","text":"Hmph. Would you like to hear what I have to say?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04793","path":"0/01/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04793.ogg","text":"Sayaka fought with her killer in the room, yes?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04798","path":"f/f0/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04798.ogg","text":"That would also explain why she would switch the nameplates."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04806","path":"f/ff/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04806.ogg","text":"Do we really have time for all that?"}]},"2":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04814","path":"0/04/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04814.ogg","text":"Perhaps if you had an alibi, that would change things."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04815","path":"4/47/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04815.ogg","text":"What is your point?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04816","path":"4/4f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04816.ogg","text":"That does make some amount of sense."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04856","path":"c/ca/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04856.ogg","text":"Ah, now I understand - It was all one big bluff, wasn't it?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04834","path":"6/6b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04834.ogg","text":"Plus, isn't there a regulation against using someone else's handbook?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04854","path":"4/45/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04854.ogg","text":"As a matter of fact, it was...blue!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04818","path":"5/5c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04818.ogg","text":"It was some kind of rope, was it not?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04820","path":"d/df/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04820.ogg","text":"Then...does that mean that the carpets were switched too?"}]},"3":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04868","path":"e/ee/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04868.ogg","text":"I'm sorry to say Hiro, but we do have evidence..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04869","path":"2/26/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04869.ogg","text":"Blueprints for the suit..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04870","path":"0/05/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04870.ogg","text":"Parts we assume were used to build it..."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04979","path":"d/db/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04979.ogg","text":"Don't make me laugh, you idiot! WHAT DO YOU MEAN \"CHECKMATE\"!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04985","path":"6/6a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04985.ogg","text":"What the hell are you talking about!? I'll burn you alive!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05005","path":"a/a2/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05005.ogg","text":"Until the game's over, you never know what might happen!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04937","path":"a/af/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04937.ogg","text":"Hmhm! I really do hate this kind of joke..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04999","path":"2/2d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04999.ogg","text":"That's the ONLY TRUTH THERE IS! MORON!"}]}}},"Chihiro Fujisaki":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Chihiro_Fujisaki","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05175","path":"e/e8/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05175.ogg","text":"What should I do?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05176","path":"0/02/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05176.ogg","text":"I-I just wanted to..."}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05129","path":"e/ee/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05129.ogg","text":"She didn't even have a chance to resist..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05130","path":"1/1b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05130.ogg","text":"A struggle? Between who... and who?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05133","path":"e/e8/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05133.ogg","text":"But, what if they did work together and they just didn't know about the rule?"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05151","path":"1/18/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05151.ogg","text":"But then the culprit took that from her too!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05156","path":"4/45/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05156.ogg","text":"Looking at it now, you can also read it as an N!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05128","path":"7/7e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05128.ogg","text":"The killer must've taken her by surprise while she was in the bathroom!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05147","path":"3/3a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05147.ogg","text":"Then they would've gone to Sayaka's room!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05149","path":"1/1a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05149.ogg","text":"But, why would she switch them in the first place?"}]}}},"Hifumi Yamada":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Hifumi_Yamada","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02392","path":"d/d3/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02392.ogg","text":"Why is that!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02395","path":"d/d1/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02395.ogg","text":"Yes indeed!"}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02297","path":"7/7f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02297.ogg","text":"Wow...this is starting to sound like a real trial!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02298","path":"3/32/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02298.ogg","text":"Mmmm, yes, then it's been decided."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02299","path":"b/b1/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02299.ogg","text":"We've reached the end!"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02306","path":"6/65/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02306.ogg","text":"I'm sorry, but I give up! Quit without saving!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02313","path":"e/e7/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02313.ogg","text":"\"I see, I see, and so the truth draws even closer!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02370","path":"8/82/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02370.ogg","text":"That's what my little ghost friend is telling me!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02301","path":"a/ad/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02301.ogg","text":"Soo, THAT'S how you would twist the argument, and send us all off in the wrong direction!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02316","path":"1/1e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02316.ogg","text":"Which means.. whoever had the kitchen knife, must've attacked first!"}]}}},"Junko Enoshima":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Junko_Enoshima","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05087","path":"2/21/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05087.ogg","text":"Hi~! I'm Junko Enoshima. Charmed, I'm sure!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05088","path":"3/35/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05088.ogg","text":"Come on..."}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05087","path":"2/21/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05087.ogg","text":"Hi~! I'm Junko Enoshima. Charmed, I'm sure!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05088","path":"3/35/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05088.ogg","text":"Come on..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05090","path":"7/78/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05090.ogg","text":"But more important..."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05118","path":"d/df/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05118.ogg","text":"The hell is wrong with you?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05100","path":"d/dc/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05100.ogg","text":"Shut the hell up!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05104","path":"1/1c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05104.ogg","text":"The hell are you talking about?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05113","path":"7/71/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05113.ogg","text":"What the hell is this?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05087","path":"2/21/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05087.ogg","text":"Hi~! I'm Junko Enoshima. Charmed, I'm sure!"}]}}},"Kiyotaka Ishimaru":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Kiyotaka_Ishimaru","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01292","path":"2/2b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01292.ogg","text":"Listen to me!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01293","path":"4/49/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01293.ogg","text":"Quiet down and listen!"}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01197","path":"4/44/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01197.ogg","text":"There was some kind of sharp object thrust into her stomach..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01199","path":"4/49/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01199.ogg","text":"It IS a problem! A boy and a girl spending the night together!? It's... It's... unwholesome!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01200","path":"c/c6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01200.ogg","text":"Wh-!? You are!? Oh my gosh, I'm so sorry!"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01200","path":"c/c6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01200.ogg","text":"Wh-!? You are!? Oh my gosh, I'm so sorry!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01204","path":"e/ef/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01204.ogg","text":"Well then, why don't we just vote right now? Majority rules!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01202","path":"6/68/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01202.ogg","text":"But are you sure we can decide something so important based solely on the absence of some hair!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01217","path":"4/4f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01217.ogg","text":"...So anyway, if Sayaka never touched the sword, then that means..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01201","path":"c/c8/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01201.ogg","text":"Then the person who took the knife was the victim herself!"}]},"2":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01224","path":"b/b9/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01224.ogg","text":"What kind of blunt instrument could it have been?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01227","path":"4/41/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01227.ogg","text":"She was acting funny, that's for sure. That melancholy tone of hers completely disappeared!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01228","path":"7/70/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01228.ogg","text":"Toko...! What happened to you?"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01273","path":"c/c4/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01273.ogg","text":"What's wrong bro? C-come on! Tell him he's wrong!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01274","path":"8/80/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01274.ogg","text":"You are wrong! You have to be wrong!\""},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01267","path":"5/5f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01267.ogg","text":"No! Wait! Hold on! You've got it all wrong! He would never kill-!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01275","path":"f/fa/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01275.ogg","text":"Everything you just said is wrong! You made it all up!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01252","path":"c/c9/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.01252.ogg","text":"Well I find it very hard to believe!"}]}}},"Kyoko Kirigiri":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Kyoko_Kirigiri","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03670","path":"7/78/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03670.ogg","text":"In other words..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03671","path":"9/99/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03671.ogg","text":"So then."}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03069","path":"6/6d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03069.ogg","text":"What's going on with... those pictures?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03070","path":"9/91/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03070.ogg","text":"Let's draw our conclusions after we presented our arguments. Otherwise, what's the point of the trial?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03071","path":"e/e6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03071.ogg","text":"I don't think that's true at all. I'm sure if we keep at it, something new will reveal itself."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03130","path":"f/f7/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03130.ogg","text":"Now do you understand? She wasn't a blameless victim in this."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03128","path":"7/77/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03128.ogg","text":"Sorry, but I don't think Sayaka used the sword."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03133","path":"c/c8/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03133.ogg","text":"The dying message! She wrote something on the wall behind her. Remember?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03157","path":"7/78/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03157.ogg","text":"Makoto, I believe you're in possession of that evidence."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03123","path":"7/77/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03123.ogg","text":"We first need to understand what happened after the person entered the room."}]},"2":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03167","path":"9/93/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03167.ogg","text":"As far as I'm concerned, there's no mistake and no room for doubt on this one."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03168","path":"b/b2/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03168.ogg","text":"There is more to it. Think about it."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03170","path":"a/a0/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03170.ogg","text":"The proof you're looking for is hidden in there."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03215","path":"1/1b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03215.ogg","text":"Not nearly as frightful as someone capable of murdering a friend."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03189","path":"4/4e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03189.ogg","text":"Because if we're wrong, we all die here."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03200","path":"6/63/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03200.ogg","text":"Why did he choose this specific tracksuit that he did?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03176","path":"8/83/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03176.ogg","text":"Don't worry, this will make the whole trial more exciting. I'm sure that thought must please you?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03180","path":"7/72/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03180.ogg","text":"Be sure to check her entire body, and I believe we will solve this particular mystery."}]},"3":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03229","path":"4/4e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03229.ogg","text":"It's still far too early to reach that conclusion."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03230","path":"d/d1/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03230.ogg","text":"Besides, there's no hurry to decide who did it."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03231","path":"8/8d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03231.ogg","text":"Before we rush to a verdict, shouldn't we explore every single possibility?"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03289","path":"5/52/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03289.ogg","text":"We've simply been led to believe that it's the other way around."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03250","path":"e/e0/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03250.ogg","text":"Well, what if I told you there was a way to make the impossible possible?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03260","path":"3/3f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03260.ogg","text":"And with that, the impossible task of moving his copious corpse becomes possible, wouldn't you say?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03275","path":"f/fd/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03275.ogg","text":"But that only really applies if there's one murder, right?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03292","path":"8/8e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03292.ogg","text":"Is it? I don't think it's ridiculous at all."}]},"4":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03306","path":"8/8f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03306.ogg","text":"When did you see that dying message of hers?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03307","path":"2/2f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03307.ogg","text":"But if you recall, Hina was very adamant about keeping you away from the scene of the crime."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03308","path":"0/05/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03308.ogg","text":"So it's hard to believe that's when you actually saw the message for yourself."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03336","path":"6/60/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03336.ogg","text":"Once you understand that point, you'll understand why two separate Monokuma bottles must've been used."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03454","path":"2/2f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03454.ogg","text":"That's what you don't understand, and that's why you couldn't solve this case."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03308","path":"0/05/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03308.ogg","text":"So it's hard to believe that's when you actually saw the message for yourself."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03348","path":"b/b0/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03348.ogg","text":"Think about what state the missing bottle must've been in, maybe then you'll understand."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03362","path":"1/1b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03362.ogg","text":"Even as strong as she is, she must've still been reeling from Hiro's attack."}]},"5":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03459","path":"1/11/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03459.ogg","text":"These gloves were custom made to the size of my hands to make sure they don't interfere with my daily life."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03460","path":"f/f2/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03460.ogg","text":"If I wore fake nails, the gloves wouldn't fit properly."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03461","path":"d/d7/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03461.ogg","text":"No, the headmaster has nothing to do with it."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03517","path":"c/ca/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03517.ogg","text":"Can you tell me I'm wrong?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03520","path":"9/94/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03520.ogg","text":"You should understand that more than anyone here."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03529","path":"0/01/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03529.ogg","text":"What do you mean 'time's up'? There's no 'time's up'! Since when have we-?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03510","path":"9/9e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03510.ogg","text":"I've never been to the dojo."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03528","path":"b/b4/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03528.ogg","text":"Then you're finally starting to understand."}]},"6":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03543","path":"f/f9/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03543.ogg","text":"And that's final? No loopholes? No wiggling out of it later?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03544","path":"9/96/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03544.ogg","text":"Yeah, I thought that must be it. But how was that a hint?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03545","path":"c/c2/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03545.ogg","text":"No, it's not a lie. Just watch the DVD and you'll see for yourself."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03613","path":"f/fc/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03613.ogg","text":"What's wrong? Lost the will to fight back?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03652","path":"b/be/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03652.ogg","text":"He would never want us to abandon Makoto and choose to stay here!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03661","path":"5/53/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03661.ogg","text":"You came here to confront despair without ever giving up."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03642","path":"3/3b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03642.ogg","text":"I can't believe it's all because of just you and Mukuro."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03654","path":"2/21/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03654.ogg","text":"Just because we don't actually know anything, does that mean we can't understand?"}]}}},"Leon Kuwata":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Leon_Kuwata","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02235","path":"3/38/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02235.ogg","text":"You know what I mean."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02236","path":"6/69/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02236.ogg","text":"Hey, listen."}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02166","path":"c/c0/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02166.ogg","text":"Well, we can talk all we want. It's not going to change that conclusion."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02168","path":"f/fe/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02168.ogg","text":"But where does that get us?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02169","path":"2/2e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02169.ogg","text":"So he really did do it!"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02182","path":"0/03/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02182.ogg","text":"Wha- HOW THE HELL CAN YOU NOT THINK THAT?!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02212","path":"7/7c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02212.ogg","text":"Listen to me! What the hell do you mean, end this!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02211","path":"d/d2/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02211.ogg","text":"These goddamn shit-for-brains have got it all wrong, I'm telling you!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02207","path":"8/8b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02207.ogg","text":"Th-that's right! There's no way! It'd be impossible!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02209","path":"f/fd/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02209.ogg","text":"Y-y-y-you can't be serious! I...! I...!"}]}}},"Mondo Owada":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Mondo_Owada","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02109","path":"4/4f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02109.ogg","text":"Hey, dammit!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02110","path":"3/39/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02110.ogg","text":"Whaaat? ...What?"}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02040","path":"d/de/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02040.ogg","text":"How could anyone do something like that? That son of a BITCH!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02041","path":"c/c6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02041.ogg","text":"Huh? A kitchen knife...?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02043","path":"5/5d/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02043.ogg","text":"And if you look real close, I could totally see that being a kitchen knife."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02046","path":"9/91/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02046.ogg","text":"Bewildering? What the hell are you talking about?!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02052","path":"3/35/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02052.ogg","text":"But we still don't know who it is, ya goddamn idiot!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02061","path":"7/7a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02061.ogg","text":"What is it, some kinda glass ball? It's busted to hell."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02040","path":"d/de/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02040.ogg","text":"How could anyone do something like that? That son of a BITCH!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02054","path":"1/1e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02054.ogg","text":"Stop jumpin' ahead! Slow down and explain it so I get what the hell's goin' on."}]},"2":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02064","path":"6/61/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02064.ogg","text":"Never made public...? What the hell is it?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02065","path":"2/2f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02065.ogg","text":"No fuckin' way!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02066","path":"f/f2/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02066.ogg","text":"What the fuck is this?!"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02067","path":"0/09/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02067.ogg","text":"The hell is wrong with you?!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02064","path":"6/61/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02064.ogg","text":"Never made public...? What the hell is it?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02070","path":"2/28/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02070.ogg","text":"Hell yes that's what happened! So that's it, right? Byakuya's the killer!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02069","path":"7/72/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02069.ogg","text":"Hey, Byakuya! Where'd you get it from, huh?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02090","path":"5/5f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02090.ogg","text":"What gives you the right to treat me like a goddamn criminal!?"}]}}},"Sakura Ogami":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Sakura_Ogami","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04702","path":"9/9f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04702.ogg","text":"So then..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04711","path":"4/4c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04711.ogg","text":"I see..."}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04570","path":"8/87/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04570.ogg","text":"So what was used to kill her?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04572","path":"f/f2/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04572.ogg","text":"I can."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04574","path":"3/3a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04574.ogg","text":"I stayed in Hina's room last night."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04576","path":"1/16/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04576.ogg","text":"Actually, there is one other possibility. Right, Hina?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04583","path":"2/24/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04583.ogg","text":"So they had no idea how unnecessary their actions were..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04584","path":"5/5b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04584.ogg","text":"Hmm... Yes. How did the killer get inside?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04570","path":"8/87/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04570.ogg","text":"So what was used to kill her?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04571","path":"0/06/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04571.ogg","text":"Which means that knife must be the murder weapon."}]},"2":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04595","path":"b/b6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04595.ogg","text":"It appears it was a head wound."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04596","path":"a/a0/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04596.ogg","text":"This one is so different from the one we've come to know."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04597","path":"b/ba/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04597.ogg","text":"...A motive?"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04611","path":"e/ed/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04611.ogg","text":"I'm sorry, Chihiro. Please excuse the intrusion."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04598","path":"d/d6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04598.ogg","text":"Do you really expect any of us to believe you?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04604","path":"b/bd/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04604.ogg","text":"That's... definitely the stain from my protein coffee!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04612","path":"2/22/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04612.ogg","text":"Her entire body? I know you say that, but..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04626","path":"c/cb/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04626.ogg","text":"Then... Mondo, how did you know what color Chihiro's tracksuit was?"}]},"3":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04631","path":"6/62/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04631.ogg","text":"So what you're saying is..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04632","path":"3/38/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04632.ogg","text":"So, what is it? What needs to be clarified?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04633","path":"3/30/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04633.ogg","text":"Okay, that explains the tarp. And the dolly?"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04683","path":"9/99/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04683.ogg","text":"He's right, though. I don't understand it, either."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04632","path":"3/38/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04632.ogg","text":"So, what is it? What needs to be clarified?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04693","path":"0/0e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04693.ogg","text":"I understand how an accomplice could be involved, but then who was the one pulling Hifumi's strings?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04695","path":"f/fc/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04695.ogg","text":"I remember her saying that too, but... I don't understand what's so strange about it."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04633","path":"3/30/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04633.ogg","text":"Okay, that explains the tarp. And the dolly?"}]}}},"Sayaka Maizono":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Sayaka_Maizono","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03022","path":"0/01/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03022.ogg","text":"Hey, um..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03024","path":"e/e4/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03024.ogg","text":"Umm, listen."}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03022","path":"0/01/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03022.ogg","text":"Hey, um..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03024","path":"e/e4/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03024.ogg","text":"Umm, listen."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03026","path":"9/9e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03026.ogg","text":"Uh, umm..."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03045","path":"b/be/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03045.ogg","text":"No matter what happens, please always be there for me. I need you on my side. sobs"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03054","path":"c/c2/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03054.ogg","text":"I'm so happy!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03064","path":"d/d8/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03064.ogg","text":"Why? Why is this happening to me!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03065","path":"e/ec/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03065.ogg","text":"To kill, or be killed, I just can't take this anymore!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03061","path":"1/10/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03061.ogg","text":"Uh- I’m fine. I hope you’re okay."}]}}},"Toko Fukawa":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Toko_Fukawa","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04257","path":"d/d7/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04257.ogg","text":"M-Makoto must've taken it f-from the kitchen, right?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04258","path":"8/8e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04258.ogg","text":"You did it in s-secret, when nobody was in the dining hall!"}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04257","path":"d/d7/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04257.ogg","text":"M-Makoto must've taken it f-from the kitchen, right?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04258","path":"8/8e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04258.ogg","text":"You did it in s-secret, when nobody was in the dining hall!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04261","path":"5/5b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04261.ogg","text":"Okay, then what about this;"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04313","path":"b/b8/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04313.ogg","text":"You can't be s-serious! That's just... I don't b-believe it!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04305","path":"b/b4/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04305.ogg","text":"I-I can't believe you! You're the worst! I hope you d-die!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04290","path":"e/e3/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04290.ogg","text":"You said if I k-kept my promise...you would g-go out with me!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04288","path":"c/c0/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04288.ogg","text":"You p-promised...! I can't b-believe you l-lied!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04303","path":"0/04/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.04303.ogg","text":"Wh-Wh-What are you saying!? No w-way! I didn't d-do it!"}]}}},"Yasuhiro Hagakure":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Yasuhiro_Hagakure","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02494","path":"8/8c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02494.ogg","text":"Ok.. so what's next?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02495","path":"b/b5/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02495.ogg","text":"You really believe that?"}],"chapters":{"1":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02494","path":"8/8c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02494.ogg","text":"Ok.. so what's next?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02495","path":"b/b5/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02495.ogg","text":"You really believe that?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02496","path":"3/31/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02496.ogg","text":"But then.. couldn't either one of them have grabbed the knife?"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02499","path":"4/49/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02499.ogg","text":"Yeah! Our necks are on the line here! Someone needs to do something, for serious!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02500","path":"2/24/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02500.ogg","text":"Alright, then it's about time to solve this mystery!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02495","path":"b/b5/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02495.ogg","text":"You really believe that?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02496","path":"3/31/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02496.ogg","text":"But then.. couldn't either one of them have grabbed the knife?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02505","path":"0/07/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02505.ogg","text":"And that's exactly what happened!"}]},"2":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02511","path":"1/11/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02511.ogg","text":"What? For real!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02512","path":"4/4a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02512.ogg","text":"Another riddle? Man, why's this gotta be so complicated?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02513","path":"3/3b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02513.ogg","text":"She's so...intense!"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02527","path":"3/30/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02527.ogg","text":"Oh! Well then yeah, I guess that'd be pretty impossible, huh?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02515","path":"8/8a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02515.ogg","text":"Could you please stop comparing killing people to cooking...?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02531","path":"b/b5/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02531.ogg","text":"Damn straight! Count me in!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02532","path":"6/6a/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02532.ogg","text":"Of course I do! What am I, an ant or somethin'?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02523","path":"9/98/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02523.ogg","text":"She used the thing that was in the main hall!"}]},"3":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02934","path":"3/3f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02934.ogg","text":"I'm Yasuhiro Hagakure—Hiro for short! Take it easy, yeah? I know I will!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02936","path":"f/fb/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02936.ogg","text":"You know."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02940","path":"e/ee/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02940.ogg","text":"No way."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02934","path":"3/3f/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02934.ogg","text":"I'm Yasuhiro Hagakure—Hiro for short! Take it easy, yeah? I know I will!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02960","path":"6/62/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02960.ogg","text":"Ah, please!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03008","path":"f/f4/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.03008.ogg","text":"Oh hey! Another new kid?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02980","path":"a/a6/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02980.ogg","text":"You got it all wrong."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02987","path":"b/b5/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.02987.ogg","text":"Can't hear you, can't hear you!"}]}}},"Genocide Jack":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Genocide_Jack","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06284","path":"2/20/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06284.ogg","text":"So you figured it out, huh? Well, whatever. What are ya gonna do?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06286","path":"d/d2/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06286.ogg","text":"Not Toko! That's a loser name! And what happened is a textbook split personality!"}],"chapters":{"2":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06284","path":"2/20/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06284.ogg","text":"So you figured it out, huh? Well, whatever. What are ya gonna do?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06286","path":"d/d2/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06286.ogg","text":"Not Toko! That's a loser name! And what happened is a textbook split personality!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06290","path":"9/9e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06290.ogg","text":"Yes, well, the world is composed of a front and a back, you know?"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06301","path":"f/fb/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06301.ogg","text":"But sorry! As much as I hate to admit it, I'm not the culprit!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06326","path":"7/72/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06326.ogg","text":"Kyaah! I can't believe I said it! I'm so embarrassed!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06319","path":"f/fa/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06319.ogg","text":"Big Mac says there's two differences, but he's wrong!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06343","path":"0/0c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06343.ogg","text":"Go ahead, tell me I'm wrong. You can't can you? Gutter dogs, all of you!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06303","path":"a/a2/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06303.ogg","text":"Sorry, but I didn't kill anyone!"}]},"3":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06363","path":"e/ed/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06363.ogg","text":"Now that's a bold assumption."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06366","path":"d/df/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06366.ogg","text":"Yeah, it'd be totally impossible! Not that I can say for sure myself..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06368","path":"4/40/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06368.ogg","text":"Pfhah! What a pain in the ass!"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06389","path":"e/ea/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06389.ogg","text":"Wh— What the hell are you talking about?!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06397","path":"8/85/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06397.ogg","text":"Then the fortune-telling idiot is the culprit after all!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06366","path":"d/df/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06366.ogg","text":"Yeah, it'd be totally impossible! Not that I can say for sure myself..."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06383","path":"d/df/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06383.ogg","text":"Ugh, yes! Why must you ruin it EVERY TIME?!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06374","path":"d/d9/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06374.ogg","text":"Because he was super good at playing dead! Badda-bing badda-boom!"}]},"4":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06400","path":"2/28/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06400.ogg","text":"My fault, Master's fault! When our faults combine, they soar to even greater heights!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06401","path":"b/b4/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06401.ogg","text":"Well, to be honest, Miss Morose and me don't actually share our memories."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06402","path":"4/4e/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06402.ogg","text":"So I can't really say what was going on."}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06436","path":"6/6c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06436.ogg","text":"I don't believe it! I don't believe it any more than I believe I can fly!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06431","path":"c/ca/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06431.ogg","text":"What's wrong with you, Big Mac? You're being awfully pushy!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06425","path":"d/d4/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06425.ogg","text":"Ahh! You're making me go all weak in the knees!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06427","path":"8/89/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06427.ogg","text":"And that's where the poison came from?! Section C?!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06423","path":"2/28/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06423.ogg","text":"So you're dead set on blaming me, huh?!"}]},"6":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06438","path":"a/a5/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06438.ogg","text":"Huh? What video?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06439","path":"4/44/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06439.ogg","text":"Who the hell are you?!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06440","path":"d/dc/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06440.ogg","text":"Oh, nice to meetcha!"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06470","path":"4/46/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06470.ogg","text":"Hell, no matter how I look, still hate it! Kyeeehahahaha!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06473","path":"4/46/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06473.ogg","text":"I can keep on living, as long as I have my master's love!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06451","path":"1/1c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06451.ogg","text":"Are you serious? I'm talking about the way the world is now."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06469","path":"3/3b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06469.ogg","text":"Actually, I may not look like it, but I've always hated school."},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06447","path":"2/21/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06447.ogg","text":"Oh no! You seriously forgot?! Maybe I can help you remember... with a kiss."}]}}},"Junko Enoshima (Real)":{"source":"https://voicelines.fandom.com/wiki/Junko_Enoshima_(Danganronpa_1)","pretrial":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06243","path":"0/07/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06243.ogg","text":"Well that's juuuuusst...!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06244","path":"8/85/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06244.ogg","text":"Totally the best!"}],"chapters":{"6":{"reveal":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05857","path":"a/a8/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05857.ogg","text":"If you swear your fealty to us, we will reward you with half of the entire world!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05858","path":"0/00/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05858.ogg","text":"We've even drawn up the deed already! We will grant you honor, status, and some of our home cooking!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05859","path":"3/32/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05859.ogg","text":"Have you made your choice? Will you serve under us?"}],"highlights":[{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05975","path":"5/52/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05975.ogg","text":"And that nourishment...is hope! Despair can grow only in the presence of hope!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06151","path":"3/3c/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06151.ogg","text":"You solved the mystery but despair at the truth, right!?"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06050","path":"b/bd/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06050.ogg","text":"Shit man, I've never been to a funeral. Hell yes!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05877","path":"7/78/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.05877.ogg","text":"And together, we were the Despair Sisters! AKA the Ultimate Despair!"},{"id":"Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06139","path":"9/9b/Dr1_voice_hca_us.awb.06139.ogg","text":"Despair is as contagious as any disease; any hope left turns to despair."}]}}}}};
})();
